{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach, take it, check properties, perform specific task. Else move or scan.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
